>>
endobj
178 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Encapsulation is the concept of bundling data \(attributes\) and methods \(functions\) that operate on that data into a single unit \(class\). It hides the internal details of an object and provides controlled access through methods.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
